(5399821, 776390, 52854, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2009-03-25 08:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5399824, 776230, 100064, '<td valign="top">I like this but I dont know why. I wouldnt hang it on my wall because I am just not a contemporary kind of person and not really liking the colors but I like something about it I just cant figure out. hahaah. One of my top ten scored in this challenge.</td>', 'I like this but I dont know why. I wouldnt hang it on my wall because I am just not a contemporary kind of person and not really liking the colors but I like something about it I just cant figure out. hahaah. One of my top ten scored in this challenge.', '2009-03-25 08:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
