(5399830, 775330, 100064, '<td valign="top">I can do without the frame but if it works for someones decor then it would still go nicely. I like the movement here. It gives a calming effect. Lord knows I need calming effects in my life. hahaha. One of my top ten highest scored in this challenge.</td>', 'I can do without the frame but if it works for someones decor then it would still go nicely. I like the movement here. It gives a calming effect. Lord knows I need calming effects in my life. hahaha. One of my top ten highest scored in this challenge.', '2009-03-25 08:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
