(5400107, 775834, 37845, '<td valign="top">I think I have been to this very same spot to take photos. Is this above the Gardiner Expressway in Toronto?</td>', 'I think I have been to this very same spot to take photos. Is this above the Gardiner Expressway in Toronto?', '2009-03-25 11:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
