(5400131, 776202, 97166, '<td valign="top">It''s a very intriguing photo, but when it comes right down to it, it''s probably just a little too advanced and/or before its time when it comes to this challenge.  Very little ''motion'' (emotion, in my eyes, doesn''t count).  The abstract, of course, is more surrealistic and psychological than physical, and probably isn''t resonating well with DPC.  I could, of course, be wrong.</td>', 'It''s a very intriguing photo, but when it comes right down to it, it''s probably just a little too advanced and/or before its time when it comes to this challenge.  Very little ''motion'' (emotion, in my eyes, doesn''t count).  The abstract, of course, is more surrealistic and psychological than physical, and probably isn''t resonating well with DPC.  I could, of course, be wrong.', '2009-03-25 11:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400134, 776074, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the colours, it reminds me of raspberry sorbet.</td>', 'I like the colours, it reminds me of raspberry sorbet.', '2009-03-25 11:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400135, 774821, 43774, '<td valign="top">It looks like stalks of wheat, good job.</td>', 'It looks like stalks of wheat, good job.', '2009-03-25 11:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
