(5400147, 776333, 97166, '<td valign="top">Simply not abstract enough I believe, and the motion is far too subtle.  Despite the movement of the camera, this remains a very static scene.</td>', 'Simply not abstract enough I believe, and the motion is far too subtle.  Despite the movement of the camera, this remains a very static scene.', '2009-03-25 11:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400149, 775043, 102024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors!  Reminds me of a small organism as it swims through it''s carefree environment.</td>', 'Wonderful colors!  Reminds me of a small organism as it swims through it''s carefree environment.', '2009-03-25 11:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400151, 776071, 97166, '<td valign="top">Slightly interesting and stark, but doesn''t fully engage me.</td>', 'Slightly interesting and stark, but doesn''t fully engage me.', '2009-03-25 11:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400152, 776378, 102024, '<td valign="top">A good composition with some wonderful colors, but something is missing that would make this image spectacular</td>', 'A good composition with some wonderful colors, but something is missing that would make this image spectacular', '2009-03-25 11:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400154, 775806, 102024, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Beautifully composed with a lovely tone to it.</td>', 'Stunning!  Beautifully composed with a lovely tone to it.', '2009-03-25 11:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400155, 776332, 97166, '<td valign="top">In abstracts, I prefer the piece to be left untitled, as they work better when the viewer is left to create their own story and vision.<br/> <br/>While I can see camera movement here, the scene is still a rather static scene, so doesn''t really work for me in the ''motion'' sense either.</td>', 'In abstracts, I prefer the piece to be left untitled, as they work better when the viewer is left to create their own story and vision. While I can see camera movement here, the scene is still a rather static scene, so doesn''t really work for me in the ''motion'' sense either.', '2009-03-25 11:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400156, 776219, 37845, '<td valign="top">I have seen many traffic motion shots before, but this is the first that I have seen that incorporates an overpass. I like the effect, and your red/orange tones stand out nicely. The only critique I would have is the bottom left corner. If your tripod was higher, you wouldnt have the fence cutting off part of the light. I doesnt affect how I will score you though. 7</td>', 'I have seen many traffic motion shots before, but this is the first that I have seen that incorporates an overpass. I like the effect, and your red/orange tones stand out nicely. The only critique I would have is the bottom left corner. If your tripod was higher, you wouldnt have the fence cutting off part of the light. I doesnt affect how I will score you though. 7', '2009-03-25 11:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400157, 775125, 97166, '<td valign="top">Not entirely sure what aspect of ''abstract'' you were going for here, and, while I swore I wouldn''t ask it, I have to wonder if you meant for this to be in the 1-second challenge and missed your upload window?</td>', 'Not entirely sure what aspect of ''abstract'' you were going for here, and, while I swore I wouldn''t ask it, I have to wonder if you meant for this to be in the 1-second challenge and missed your upload window?', '2009-03-25 11:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400158, 776040, 102024, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The colors are nice, but something about this feels off... maybe that''s what you wanted...</td>', 'Very interesting.  The colors are nice, but something about this feels off... maybe that''s what you wanted...', '2009-03-25 11:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400160, 776200, 97166, '<td valign="top">An incredibly engaging scene with some brilliant color work and energy.</td>', 'An incredibly engaging scene with some brilliant color work and energy.', '2009-03-25 11:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400162, 775908, 97166, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t get any sense of ''abstract'' from this photo.</td>', 'I personally don''t get any sense of ''abstract'' from this photo.', '2009-03-25 11:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400164, 774971, 102024, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t think this is abstract.  The subject is quite obvious.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t think this is abstract.  The subject is quite obvious.', '2009-03-25 11:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400165, 776268, 37845, '<td valign="top">I like how all the lines converge toward the top... great effect. I am assuming that you zoom in or out during the exposure.</td>', 'I like how all the lines converge toward the top... great effect. I am assuming that you zoom in or out during the exposure.', '2009-03-25 11:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400168, 774691, 97166, '<td valign="top">Love the energy here, and while I do recognize the subject, it has been put forth for consideration in an abstract manner.  <br/> <br/>I find, while looking, that a call for deeper colors in order to cement the feel of movement may have helped it a little.</td>', 'Love the energy here, and while I do recognize the subject, it has been put forth for consideration in an abstract manner.   I find, while looking, that a call for deeper colors in order to cement the feel of movement may have helped it a little.', '2009-03-25 11:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400171, 776109, 97166, '<td valign="top">There''s some nice light play, but the over-all feel is a little dull for me. I''m also not really feeling much of a sense of motion here.</td>', 'There''s some nice light play, but the over-all feel is a little dull for me. I''m also not really feeling much of a sense of motion here.', '2009-03-25 11:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400178, 775806, 97166, '<td valign="top">The colors are pleasing here, but the sense of motion is a little too subtle for me.  I can see the motion blur, but the overall sense of the photo is one of calm and passiveness.</td>', 'The colors are pleasing here, but the sense of motion is a little too subtle for me.  I can see the motion blur, but the overall sense of the photo is one of calm and passiveness.', '2009-03-25 11:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400192, 775778, 105243, '<td valign="top">Excellent snap...perfect for the topic...when looked at for some time u feel that something is in motion.</td>', 'Excellent snap...perfect for the topic...when looked at for some time u feel that something is in motion.', '2009-03-25 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400201, 776317, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m enjoying the energy here, but the title brings it down a little.  The problem with abstracts being given titles is that you are forcing your idea on the viewer, where abstracts work best when the viewer is left to decide on their own.<br/> <br/><b>Special Addition:</b>  Your photo was the proud recipient of my 1000th comment!  Ok, maybe not so proud, but there you go :)</td>', 'I''m enjoying the energy here, but the title brings it down a little.  The problem with abstracts being given titles is that you are forcing your idea on the viewer, where abstracts work best when the viewer is left to decide on their own. Special Addition:  Your photo was the proud recipient of my 1000th comment!  Ok, maybe not so proud, but there you go :)', '2009-03-25 11:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5400225, 775908, 7786, '<td valign="top">Its motion but its not really abstract. It´s clearly a waterfall so the abstraction is absent.</td>', 'Its motion but its not really abstract. It´s clearly a waterfall so the abstraction is absent.', '2009-03-25 12:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
