(5401507, 776244, 105012, '<td valign="top">Concept and composition are very good.  Somehow, though, I''m left with more of a feel of out-of-focus rather than motion.</td>', 'Concept and composition are very good.  Somehow, though, I''m left with more of a feel of out-of-focus rather than motion.', '2009-03-26 00:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401508, 776109, 105012, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot, but not sure a get a sense of motion...</td>', 'I like it a lot, but not sure a get a sense of motion...', '2009-03-26 00:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401509, 775325, 105012, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured a sense of motion, rather than the more common "blur".</td>', 'You''ve captured a sense of motion, rather than the more common "blur".', '2009-03-26 00:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401511, 774798, 105012, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but not sure it captures a sense of motion.</td>', 'I like the photo, but not sure it captures a sense of motion.', '2009-03-26 01:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401513, 776334, 105012, '<td valign="top">Nice. The range of colors --- from light in the upper right to the darker blue in the lower left -- is particularly striking.  I do get more of a sense of blur than of motion....</td>', 'Nice. The range of colors --- from light in the upper right to the darker blue in the lower left -- is particularly striking.  I do get more of a sense of blur than of motion....', '2009-03-26 01:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401515, 775402, 105012, '<td valign="top">Very hot.  Would make a great ad for a snowboard company.</td>', 'Very hot.  Would make a great ad for a snowboard company.', '2009-03-26 01:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401516, 776360, 105012, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of some mornings after...</td>', 'Reminds me of some mornings after...', '2009-03-26 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401518, 775909, 105012, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful photo, but for me, the blurred background with the crystal clear stationary view of the birds'' wings, captures stillness rather than motion.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful photo, but for me, the blurred background with the crystal clear stationary view of the birds'' wings, captures stillness rather than motion.', '2009-03-26 01:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401521, 775969, 105012, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  I could see it being used for a subtle and classy "Don''t drink and drive" campaign.</td>', 'Very cool.  I could see it being used for a subtle and classy "Don''t drink and drive" campaign.', '2009-03-26 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401522, 775255, 105012, '<td valign="top">Definitely very cool.  But these kinds of shots, where the background is blurred and the object is crystal clear, captures more a sense of stillness than of motion.</td>', 'Definitely very cool.  But these kinds of shots, where the background is blurred and the object is crystal clear, captures more a sense of stillness than of motion.', '2009-03-26 01:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401523, 776227, 105012, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2009-03-26 01:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401524, 776103, 105012, '<td valign="top">Cool. Love the blue.</td>', 'Cool. Love the blue.', '2009-03-26 01:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401525, 775834, 105012, '<td valign="top">Well done, but somewhat overdone in terms of the topic.</td>', 'Well done, but somewhat overdone in terms of the topic.', '2009-03-26 01:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401527, 775026, 105012, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, but doesn''t really give me a sense of motion.</td>', 'Cool photo, but doesn''t really give me a sense of motion.', '2009-03-26 01:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401529, 776243, 105012, '<td valign="top">Like a painting.  Love the color.  But I get more of a sense of blur and heat rather than motion.</td>', 'Like a painting.  Love the color.  But I get more of a sense of blur and heat rather than motion.', '2009-03-26 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401531, 776318, 105012, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen 170 photos before getting to this one, so I have a good sense of things.  This is excellent.  The composition is beautiful and well balanced.  I would like to see it as a pattern on fabric -- and then used on a large piece of furniture or a bed spread.  I know I''m not the only one who''s glad to see you behind the camera again.  What''s going to be our next challenge???  d</td>', 'I''ve seen 170 photos before getting to this one, so I have a good sense of things.  This is excellent.  The composition is beautiful and well balanced.  I would like to see it as a pattern on fabric -- and then used on a large piece of furniture or a bed spread.  I know I''m not the only one who''s glad to see you behind the camera again.  What''s going to be our next challenge???  d', '2009-03-26 01:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401533, 776101, 105012, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Somewhat reminiscent of a Dutch photographer''s work I handle named Karel van Wolferan.  Check out our current show and I think you''ll see what I mean:  www.yuanfenart.com</td>', 'Very cool.  Somewhat reminiscent of a Dutch photographer''s work I handle named Karel van Wolferan.  Check out our current show and I think you''ll see what I mean:  www.yuanfenart.com', '2009-03-26 01:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401534, 776124, 105012, '<td valign="top">Well done, but overdone (thematically).</td>', 'Well done, but overdone (thematically).', '2009-03-26 01:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401537, 775075, 105012, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2009-03-26 01:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401541, 776390, 94235, '<td valign="top">Colors jump out at you. Well framed, but for the life of me I can''t guess what it is!</td>', 'Colors jump out at you. Well framed, but for the life of me I can''t guess what it is!', '2009-03-26 01:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401543, 775536, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks like a portion of Monet''s water lillies. Soft and soothing. Nicely done.</td>', 'Looks like a portion of Monet''s water lillies. Soft and soothing. Nicely done.', '2009-03-26 01:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401544, 776074, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice effect, especially the upper background. The white area looks a little too bright in the middle but I love the rest.</td>', 'Nice effect, especially the upper background. The white area looks a little too bright in the middle but I love the rest.', '2009-03-26 01:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401547, 776159, 13759, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The tones was a bit pushed to blue, obvious intent. But is nice and graceful.</td>', 'Great shot. The tones was a bit pushed to blue, obvious intent. But is nice and graceful.', '2009-03-26 01:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401548, 776274, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good color and effect. Well framed.</td>', 'Good color and effect. Well framed.', '2009-03-26 01:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401550, 776339, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. Didn''t like how one side was brighter than the other but on a second look I don''t mind the effect now.</td>', 'Nice and simple. Didn''t like how one side was brighter than the other but on a second look I don''t mind the effect now.', '2009-03-26 01:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401551, 776319, 105012, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2009-03-26 01:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401552, 776212, 105012, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors.</td>', 'beautiful colors.', '2009-03-26 01:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401554, 776367, 105012, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.</td>', 'Excellent composition.', '2009-03-26 01:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401556, 776200, 94235, '<td valign="top">If this is water I think you have done a great job because now it looks like a streak of fresh paint brushed onto a flat surface.....or maybe I''ve just been looking at these abstracts too long!</td>', 'If this is water I think you have done a great job because now it looks like a streak of fresh paint brushed onto a flat surface.....or maybe I''ve just been looking at these abstracts too long!', '2009-03-26 01:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401557, 776146, 105012, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2009-03-26 01:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401558, 776139, 94235, '<td valign="top">Apt title....gee is it that time already! Nicely done.</td>', 'Apt title....gee is it that time already! Nicely done.', '2009-03-26 01:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401559, 775824, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice effect although the blown out right side is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice effect although the blown out right side is a little distracting.', '2009-03-26 01:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401560, 774700, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great soft blend of color although the sensor dust on the yellow part spoils it a little.</td>', 'Great soft blend of color although the sensor dust on the yellow part spoils it a little.', '2009-03-26 01:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401561, 775584, 105012, '<td valign="top">It''s beautiful, but I don''t get a sense of motion.</td>', 'It''s beautiful, but I don''t get a sense of motion.', '2009-03-26 01:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401562, 776402, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great color and effect. Wouldn''t like to ride that elevator, all the buttons look the same!</td>', 'Great color and effect. Wouldn''t like to ride that elevator, all the buttons look the same!', '2009-03-26 01:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401563, 776202, 105012, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph -- and the mood --- but I get more of a sense of ghostly than "motion"...</td>', 'I like the photograph -- and the mood --- but I get more of a sense of ghostly than "motion"...', '2009-03-26 01:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401564, 776308, 94235, '<td valign="top">I''ve scored this well even though I think it would have been much better without the lines of light on the upper right. The colors in the rest of the shot are great.</td>', 'I''ve scored this well even though I think it would have been much better without the lines of light on the upper right. The colors in the rest of the shot are great.', '2009-03-26 01:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401565, 775828, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good effect and framing. Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Good effect and framing. Meets the challenge well.', '2009-03-26 01:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401566, 774821, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and well titled. I might have boosted the color a little.</td>', 'Nice capture and well titled. I might have boosted the color a little.', '2009-03-26 01:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401567, 776317, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and colors. I maybe would have cropped out more of the top to get a the full impact of the abstract</td>', 'Nice shot and colors. I maybe would have cropped out more of the top to get a the full impact of the abstract', '2009-03-26 01:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401568, 776306, 105012, '<td valign="top">Cool. Great composition.</td>', 'Cool. Great composition.', '2009-03-26 01:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401569, 776383, 94235, '<td valign="top">Rich vibrant colors and good simple frame. Yep, I reckon that could hang on my study wall.</td>', 'Rich vibrant colors and good simple frame. Yep, I reckon that could hang on my study wall.', '2009-03-26 01:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401570, 774734, 105012, '<td valign="top">Very cool.</td>', 'Very cool.', '2009-03-26 01:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401571, 774592, 94235, '<td valign="top">You shouldn''t have given it up that easy. People would have been guessing for ages. Great colors and very mysterious without looking at the title.</td>', 'You shouldn''t have given it up that easy. People would have been guessing for ages. Great colors and very mysterious without looking at the title.', '2009-03-26 01:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401573, 775314, 105012, '<td valign="top">Very cool and very successful in capturing "abstract motion".</td>', 'Very cool and very successful in capturing "abstract motion".', '2009-03-26 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401574, 776348, 105012, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  Not sure I get a strong sense of "motion", but it is stunning.</td>', 'Beautiful!  Not sure I get a strong sense of "motion", but it is stunning.', '2009-03-26 01:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401575, 775699, 105012, '<td valign="top">Like a painting!</td>', 'Like a painting!', '2009-03-26 01:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401576, 776071, 105012, '<td valign="top">I like the photo, but I don''t get a sense of motion from it.</td>', 'I like the photo, but I don''t get a sense of motion from it.', '2009-03-26 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401577, 776239, 105012, '<td valign="top">I love the motion captured in the "moving" fur juxtaposed against the stillness of both the foreground and background.  Excellent composition.</td>', 'I love the motion captured in the "moving" fur juxtaposed against the stillness of both the foreground and background.  Excellent composition.', '2009-03-26 01:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401578, 776322, 105012, '<td valign="top">So much like a painting... Love the colors.</td>', 'So much like a painting... Love the colors.', '2009-03-26 01:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401579, 776156, 105012, '<td valign="top">The color contrasts enhance the feeling of motion.  Excellent.</td>', 'The color contrasts enhance the feeling of motion.  Excellent.', '2009-03-26 01:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401582, 776291, 105012, '<td valign="top">I really like this.  A number of others also used a bird, but almost uniformly they captured the bird "still" --- with the background moving, thus, in my mind not conveying "motion".  Yours succeeds where the others did not.  Congratulations.</td>', 'I really like this.  A number of others also used a bird, but almost uniformly they captured the bird "still" --- with the background moving, thus, in my mind not conveying "motion".  Yours succeeds where the others did not.  Congratulations.', '2009-03-26 01:57:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5401598, 775202, 100205, '<td valign="top">great colour!</td>', 'great colour!', '2009-03-26 02:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401600, 774691, 100205, '<td valign="top">Red Riding Hood escaping? Even this blur manages to tell a story, though photographically it looks a bit overexposed - especially when the main part is set against the rich lines of the background.</td>', 'Red Riding Hood escaping? Even this blur manages to tell a story, though photographically it looks a bit overexposed - especially when the main part is set against the rich lines of the background.', '2009-03-26 02:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401603, 775255, 100205, '<td valign="top">perfect focus, though I don''t think it really fits ''abstract motion'' as it''s fairly obviously a seagull, and although I guess it''s moving, the photograph itself doesn''t give any indication of a feeling of movement.</td>', 'perfect focus, though I don''t think it really fits ''abstract motion'' as it''s fairly obviously a seagull, and although I guess it''s moving, the photograph itself doesn''t give any indication of a feeling of movement.', '2009-03-26 02:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401605, 775283, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great tones with the color on the water and the splashes.</td>', 'Great tones with the color on the water and the splashes.', '2009-03-26 03:10:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401607, 775260, 94235, '<td valign="top">I know it''s abstract but I would have loved to see this one without the white blotch in the upper middle. The effect of the rest is, well....fantastic!</td>', 'I know it''s abstract but I would have loved to see this one without the white blotch in the upper middle. The effect of the rest is, well....fantastic!', '2009-03-26 03:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401608, 774736, 94235, '<td valign="top">If Shrek was on fire this is what the flames would look like. Beautiful effect but now I''m going to watch the video to make sure he''s okay!</td>', 'If Shrek was on fire this is what the flames would look like. Beautiful effect but now I''m going to watch the video to make sure he''s okay!', '2009-03-26 03:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401609, 776076, 94235, '<td valign="top">Cool colors. Like the bars and the overall effect.</td>', 'Cool colors. Like the bars and the overall effect.', '2009-03-26 03:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401611, 775806, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks like the underside of an oriental umbrella. Lovely tones and very pleasing on the eye.</td>', 'Looks like the underside of an oriental umbrella. Lovely tones and very pleasing on the eye.', '2009-03-26 03:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401613, 775910, 94235, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit like a spider went for a walk in a neon paint factory. Great effect. Well done.</td>', 'Looks a bit like a spider went for a walk in a neon paint factory. Great effect. Well done.', '2009-03-26 03:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401625, 776101, 100205, '<td valign="top">Stunning landscape. But for me, it''s not quite ''abstract'' enough to get the full votes it deserves. Others may see it differently.</td>', 'Stunning landscape. But for me, it''s not quite ''abstract'' enough to get the full votes it deserves. Others may see it differently.', '2009-03-26 03:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401626, 776196, 100205, '<td valign="top">the colour and patterns of light within the overall spiral is great. The white light in the bottom left is distracting for me though</td>', 'the colour and patterns of light within the overall spiral is great. The white light in the bottom left is distracting for me though', '2009-03-26 03:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401627, 776052, 100205, '<td valign="top">Interesting contrast between bright cheerful colours and yet the face and teeth are nightmare material!</td>', 'Interesting contrast between bright cheerful colours and yet the face and teeth are nightmare material!', '2009-03-26 03:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401628, 776165, 100205, '<td valign="top">I do love the bright colours. I feel that having something crisp to focus my eye on would make it hold my attention for longer. But as this is an abstract challenge maybe that would make the subject too obvious?</td>', 'I do love the bright colours. I feel that having something crisp to focus my eye on would make it hold my attention for longer. But as this is an abstract challenge maybe that would make the subject too obvious?', '2009-03-26 03:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401638, 776023, 94235, '<td valign="top">An abstract of smileys, cool. Nice colors.</td>', 'An abstract of smileys, cool. Nice colors.', '2009-03-26 04:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401639, 775895, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft colors. The wooden ball in the middle looks effective especially with the peeling paint around the edges.</td>', 'Lovely soft colors. The wooden ball in the middle looks effective especially with the peeling paint around the edges.', '2009-03-26 04:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401640, 775823, 94235, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. The roof line in the upper back ground adds while the perspective from the rider''s seat is a good one.</td>', 'Interesting effect. The roof line in the upper back ground adds while the perspective from the rider''s seat is a good one.', '2009-03-26 04:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401641, 776254, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice effect and good centered focal point.</td>', 'Nice effect and good centered focal point.', '2009-03-26 04:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401643, 774737, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great effect. Looks like tiny leaves falling from a delicate Japanese maple.</td>', 'Great effect. Looks like tiny leaves falling from a delicate Japanese maple.', '2009-03-26 04:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401644, 776162, 94235, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a tie dyed outfit from the 70''s. Peace out man!</td>', 'Reminds me of a tie dyed outfit from the 70''s. Peace out man!', '2009-03-26 04:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401647, 775999, 94235, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well. Effective shot. Well done.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well. Effective shot. Well done.', '2009-03-26 04:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401648, 776211, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like the colors and the symmetry. Looks like it was taken in the bathroom judging on the hand rail.</td>', 'Like the colors and the symmetry. Looks like it was taken in the bathroom judging on the hand rail.', '2009-03-26 04:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401650, 775839, 94235, '<td valign="top">I like the effect here. The coarse and fine lines blend well. The spots catch my eye a bit. Are they dust or part of the scene?</td>', 'I like the effect here. The coarse and fine lines blend well. The spots catch my eye a bit. Are they dust or part of the scene?', '2009-03-26 04:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401652, 776143, 94235, '<td valign="top">An apt description in the title for this one. Great colors and well done.</td>', 'An apt description in the title for this one. Great colors and well done.', '2009-03-26 04:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401653, 775678, 94235, '<td valign="top">If your objects look like this you need to tighten that mirror or stop driving under the influence! Effective abstract. Well shot.</td>', 'If your objects look like this you need to tighten that mirror or stop driving under the influence! Effective abstract. Well shot.', '2009-03-26 04:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401655, 774467, 94235, '<td valign="top">The scratchy look is effective. Appears like something is hiding in a dark cave.  There again it might just be time for my medication!</td>', 'The scratchy look is effective. Appears like something is hiding in a dark cave.  There again it might just be time for my medication!', '2009-03-26 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401656, 776156, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. Good job. Well done.</td>', 'Nice lines. Good job. Well done.', '2009-03-26 05:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401657, 776373, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice use of frame. The simplicity of this shot and the fading trail make it a gem.</td>', 'Nice use of frame. The simplicity of this shot and the fading trail make it a gem.', '2009-03-26 05:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401661, 776113, 94235, '<td valign="top">There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.</td>', 'There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.', '2009-03-26 05:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401662, 774798, 94235, '<td valign="top">There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.</td>', 'There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.', '2009-03-26 05:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401665, 775236, 94235, '<td valign="top">Effective take.</td>', 'Effective take.', '2009-03-26 05:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401666, 776124, 94235, '<td valign="top">There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.</td>', 'There is motion in the lava but you really can''t class it as abstract.', '2009-03-26 05:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401667, 776070, 94235, '<td valign="top">Can''t really find the abstract motion in this one.</td>', 'Can''t really find the abstract motion in this one.', '2009-03-26 05:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401668, 775899, 94235, '<td valign="top">Abstract motion in the reflection is good.</td>', 'Abstract motion in the reflection is good.', '2009-03-26 05:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401669, 775408, 94235, '<td valign="top">It''s small but I''ll give it to you, there is some abstract motion there.</td>', 'It''s small but I''ll give it to you, there is some abstract motion there.', '2009-03-26 05:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401670, 774595, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good capture.</td>', 'Good capture.', '2009-03-26 05:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401671, 775776, 94235, '<td valign="top">Don''t really get the title of this one.</td>', 'Don''t really get the title of this one.', '2009-03-26 05:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401677, 775908, 94235, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if we class this as motion blur or abstract motion. I hate these ambiguous challenge titles. Good shot all the same.</td>', 'Don''t know if we class this as motion blur or abstract motion. I hate these ambiguous challenge titles. Good shot all the same.', '2009-03-26 05:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401678, 776244, 94235, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Nice color.</td>', 'Good shot. Nice color.', '2009-03-26 05:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401681, 776293, 36141, '<td valign="top">There is some motion, but not nearly enough and it''s lacking abstract at all.</td>', 'There is some motion, but not nearly enough and it''s lacking abstract at all.', '2009-03-26 05:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401682, 775061, 36141, '<td valign="top">Yes, very nice abstract motion. Fits the rules perfectly.</td>', 'Yes, very nice abstract motion. Fits the rules perfectly.', '2009-03-26 05:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401683, 775999, 36141, '<td valign="top">Meeting the rules, nice composition.</td>', 'Meeting the rules, nice composition.', '2009-03-26 05:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401685, 776205, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract motion, meeting the rules perfectly.</td>', 'Nice abstract motion, meeting the rules perfectly.', '2009-03-26 05:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401686, 774845, 36141, '<td valign="top">Meeting the rules, it''s not a WOW for me, but above average.</td>', 'Meeting the rules, it''s not a WOW for me, but above average.', '2009-03-26 05:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401688, 776377, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract motion, meeting the rules.</td>', 'Nice abstract motion, meeting the rules.', '2009-03-26 05:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5401689, 775913, 36141, '<td valign="top">There is motion, but not abstract enough for me. More blur would have done the trick I think.</td>', 'There is motion, but not abstract enough for me. More blur would have done the trick I think.', '2009-03-26 05:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
