(5402871, 776239, 36141, '<td valign="top">Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness<br/> <br/>Though the squirrels are in motion, the picture in its whole lacks the abstract.</td>', 'Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness Though the squirrels are in motion, the picture in its whole lacks the abstract.', '2009-03-26 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
