(5402886, 775254, 36141, '<td valign="top">It''s meeting the rules, but I would have loved to see the green again somewhere else in this picture. Now it''s a bit distracting, my eyes keep moving towards the upper left corner.</td>', 'It''s meeting the rules, but I would have loved to see the green again somewhere else in this picture. Now it''s a bit distracting, my eyes keep moving towards the upper left corner.', '2009-03-26 20:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402888, 775283, 36141, '<td valign="top">It certainly gives the impression of a big, big storm. Didn''t know at first if I liked the pink color, but looking at it a bit longer, they bother me less and less. Interesting take on the contest.</td>', 'It certainly gives the impression of a big, big storm. Didn''t know at first if I liked the pink color, but looking at it a bit longer, they bother me less and less. Interesting take on the contest.', '2009-03-26 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402890, 775968, 36141, '<td valign="top">It''s meeting the rules, but somehow is not saying WOW to me. Really like the the colors and motion in the right part though.</td>', 'It''s meeting the rules, but somehow is not saying WOW to me. Really like the the colors and motion in the right part though.', '2009-03-26 20:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402896, 774793, 36141, '<td valign="top">Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.<br/> <br/>Your photo looks more like a ''stopped'' motion than an abstract motion. Maybe if it wasn''t so obvious a glass full of liquid it would have tricked me into liking it more. Maybe a tighter crop of only the part with the green would have fit the rules better. That''s a very nice part.</td>', 'Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness. Your photo looks more like a ''stopped'' motion than an abstract motion. Maybe if it wasn''t so obvious a glass full of liquid it would have tricked me into liking it more. Maybe a tighter crop of only the part with the green would have fit the rules better. That''s a very nice part.', '2009-03-26 20:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5402897, 775776, 36141, '<td valign="top">Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.<br/> <br/>If your whole photo would have looked like the lower right and left corner, I would have said WOW.</td>', 'Abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness. If your whole photo would have looked like the lower right and left corner, I would have said WOW.', '2009-03-26 20:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
