(5403518, 776332, 36141, '<td valign="top">I would have loved it more if it had been less recognizable. <br/> <br/>Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.</td>', 'I would have loved it more if it had been less recognizable.  Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.', '2009-03-27 07:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403519, 774772, 36141, '<td valign="top">Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.<br/> <br/>Not abstract enough for my taste, it looks more like a stopped motion.</td>', 'Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness. Not abstract enough for my taste, it looks more like a stopped motion.', '2009-03-27 07:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403520, 775824, 36141, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract tornado motion. Nice colors too.</td>', 'Lovely abstract tornado motion. Nice colors too.', '2009-03-27 07:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403521, 776231, 36141, '<td valign="top">Meeting the rules, not sure if I would have like a bit more contrast, but overall a very nice take on the contest.</td>', 'Meeting the rules, not sure if I would have like a bit more contrast, but overall a very nice take on the contest.', '2009-03-27 07:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403523, 775256, 36141, '<td valign="top">Nice take, not sure if I would have loved to see a bit more of the top or would have cropped it out all together.</td>', 'Nice take, not sure if I would have loved to see a bit more of the top or would have cropped it out all together.', '2009-03-27 07:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403526, 775908, 36141, '<td valign="top">Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness.<br/> <br/>Not enough abstract for my taste in this photo.</td>', 'Definition of abstract is: art in which the subject is represented by shapes and patterns rather than by a realistic likeness. Not enough abstract for my taste in this photo.', '2009-03-27 07:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403527, 776040, 36141, '<td valign="top">Ah, really love this one, nice bright colors and I really like the little playfull whites.</td>', 'Ah, really love this one, nice bright colors and I really like the little playfull whites.', '2009-03-27 07:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403529, 776165, 76585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, the colors are brilliant. Maybe a tighter crop would have made it more abstract. 6</td>', 'Beautiful shot, the colors are brilliant. Maybe a tighter crop would have made it more abstract. 6', '2009-03-27 07:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403533, 776074, 76585, '<td valign="top">I love the rays of light shooting down and all the movement. Nice shot.</td>', 'I love the rays of light shooting down and all the movement. Nice shot.', '2009-03-27 07:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403534, 775917, 76585, '<td valign="top">Great job with the motion blur.</td>', 'Great job with the motion blur.', '2009-03-27 07:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403545, 774449, 76585, '<td valign="top">Good use of motion blur, but I don''t see much that is abstract.</td>', 'Good use of motion blur, but I don''t see much that is abstract.', '2009-03-27 07:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403547, 776246, 76585, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur shot, not much about it is abstract.</td>', 'Great motion blur shot, not much about it is abstract.', '2009-03-27 07:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403549, 775584, 93565, '<td valign="top">The lines in this remind me of feathers, or perhaps petals on a flower. This is suffciently blurred to be interesting and not so much that it''s a mess. Great job.</td>', 'The lines in this remind me of feathers, or perhaps petals on a flower. This is suffciently blurred to be interesting and not so much that it''s a mess. Great job.', '2009-03-27 07:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403551, 776343, 76585, '<td valign="top">Nice soft shot, not very abstract.</td>', 'Nice soft shot, not very abstract.', '2009-03-27 07:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403552, 775832, 93565, '<td valign="top">Now, I might be wrong, but methinks the frenetic pace of the coloring isn''t helping that whole "color inside the lines" thing.<br/>I could easily see this as a stock photo.</td>', 'Now, I might be wrong, but methinks the frenetic pace of the coloring isn''t helping that whole "color inside the lines" thing.I could easily see this as a stock photo.', '2009-03-27 07:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403553, 776316, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great use of complementary colors, and the simple border sets things off well.</td>', 'Great use of complementary colors, and the simple border sets things off well.', '2009-03-27 07:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403554, 776143, 76585, '<td valign="top">This to me is more of a time shot, a very good one I might add. It''s not abstract enough for me. Good luck 6</td>', 'This to me is more of a time shot, a very good one I might add. It''s not abstract enough for me. Good luck 6', '2009-03-27 07:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403556, 776244, 76585, '<td valign="top">Nice work, could have been a bit more abstract. 6</td>', 'Nice work, could have been a bit more abstract. 6', '2009-03-27 07:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403557, 776261, 76585, '<td valign="top">I think the bw effect takes away from what could have been an awesome shot. You''ve got the motion blur right on.</td>', 'I think the bw effect takes away from what could have been an awesome shot. You''ve got the motion blur right on.', '2009-03-27 08:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403565, 776000, 76585, '<td valign="top">A painted picture, a watercolor. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'A painted picture, a watercolor. Beautiful shot.', '2009-03-27 08:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403566, 775919, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition ~ use of perspective, the single strong color, and the two lights well placed in terms of the rule of thirds.  Great image.</td>', 'Lovely composition ~ use of perspective, the single strong color, and the two lights well placed in terms of the rule of thirds.  Great image.', '2009-03-27 08:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403567, 776308, 76585, '<td valign="top">It looks like it could be the inside of a rainbow, beautiful.</td>', 'It looks like it could be the inside of a rainbow, beautiful.', '2009-03-27 08:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403571, 774734, 76585, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great motion blur.</td>', 'Nice shot, great motion blur.', '2009-03-27 08:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403573, 775831, 93565, '<td valign="top">I think this is more interesting than the standard car shots of the same vein. It''s cool how the sky almost looks fluid, as though it were melting away.</td>', 'I think this is more interesting than the standard car shots of the same vein. It''s cool how the sky almost looks fluid, as though it were melting away.', '2009-03-27 08:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403577, 776326, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like the background of this, specifically the way it melds together like a colored pencil drawing, but the hardcore grain of the child is somewhat offputting.</td>', 'I like the background of this, specifically the way it melds together like a colored pencil drawing, but the hardcore grain of the child is somewhat offputting.', '2009-03-27 08:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403581, 776023, 76585, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and yes, it looks like all of the above. Canvas, palette, and or art. Nice work.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and yes, it looks like all of the above. Canvas, palette, and or art. Nice work.', '2009-03-27 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403585, 776239, 93565, '<td valign="top">Given the season, I think they''re doing a bit more than just having fun. Pretty sure the one on the right is copping a feel in preparation of later escapades.</td>', 'Given the season, I think they''re doing a bit more than just having fun. Pretty sure the one on the right is copping a feel in preparation of later escapades.', '2009-03-27 08:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403587, 776340, 76585, '<td valign="top">A beautiful motion blur shot.</td>', 'A beautiful motion blur shot.', '2009-03-27 08:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403591, 775701, 93565, '<td valign="top">And here I was thinking the lionfish couldn''t get any more psychadelic...<br/>Not sure how practical this would be, but I think fish would be the ideal creature for motion panning. They don''t move to fast, so are easy to track, the rear of their body moves while the head stays more stationary... so you''d have this oddball head thing melting into the panned background. Just a thought.</td>', 'And here I was thinking the lionfish couldn''t get any more psychadelic...Not sure how practical this would be, but I think fish would be the ideal creature for motion panning. They don''t move to fast, so are easy to track, the rear of their body moves while the head stays more stationary... so you''d have this oddball head thing melting into the panned background. Just a thought.', '2009-03-27 08:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403592, 775999, 76585, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, the title is right on.</td>', 'Cool shot, the title is right on.', '2009-03-27 08:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403593, 774710, 76585, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur shot.</td>', 'Great motion blur shot.', '2009-03-27 08:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403597, 774821, 93565, '<td valign="top">This is probably one of my favorites from the challenge. I''m sorta curious how you achieved this motion. It looks like wheat/grass combined with stalks maybe? But how did you move it to create this....will have to wait for the end of the challenge.<br/>Regardless, cool.</td>', 'This is probably one of my favorites from the challenge. I''m sorta curious how you achieved this motion. It looks like wheat/grass combined with stalks maybe? But how did you move it to create this....will have to wait for the end of the challenge.Regardless, cool.', '2009-03-27 08:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403598, 776052, 76585, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, I just feel it is more blur than abstract motion. 6</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, I just feel it is more blur than abstract motion. 6', '2009-03-27 08:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403603, 776293, 93565, '<td valign="top">Oh boy, T&amp;G hardwood floor installation. Makes my lower back ache just looking at this.<br/>I would''ve liked a bit more contrast on this. Maybe more "abstractness," but that''s all sorta personal opinion, I guess.</td>', 'Oh boy, T&G hardwood floor installation. Makes my lower back ache just looking at this.I would''ve liked a bit more contrast on this. Maybe more "abstractness," but that''s all sorta personal opinion, I guess.', '2009-03-27 08:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5403608, 776192, 76585, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great use of the motion blur.</td>', 'Nice shot, great use of the motion blur.', '2009-03-27 08:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
