(5404195, 775125, 103142, '<td valign="top">My first reaction is that it''s not abstract enough, and I''m afraid your going to get hit for that. Can''t mark it down too much, because I really like it. 8</td>', 'My first reaction is that it''s not abstract enough, and I''m afraid your going to get hit for that. Can''t mark it down too much, because I really like it. 8', '2009-03-27 18:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
