(5404197, 776003, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very interesting! I hope you give us the details, because I can''t figure out how the background looks the way it does, with how the crow looks. I would have assumed that you moved the camera up and down for the background, but that doesn''t fit with the crow. I like it!</td>', 'Very interesting! I hope you give us the details, because I can''t figure out how the background looks the way it does, with how the crow looks. I would have assumed that you moved the camera up and down for the background, but that doesn''t fit with the crow. I like it!', '2009-03-27 18:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404198, 776246, 103142, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot! Abstract enough for me, and very interesting. I like the soft colors, but it is tempting to see what it looks like a little more saturated.</td>', 'Lovely shot! Abstract enough for me, and very interesting. I like the soft colors, but it is tempting to see what it looks like a little more saturated.', '2009-03-27 18:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
