(5404202, 775057, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting. When I first looked at it, I didn''t care for it--but I''m just getting used to abstracts (they''re really not my thing.) But it grows on you the more you look at it.  -7</td>', 'Interesting. When I first looked at it, I didn''t care for it--but I''m just getting used to abstracts (they''re really not my thing.) But it grows on you the more you look at it.  -7', '2009-03-27 18:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
