(5404216, 776254, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I like the colors. I''d be tempted to brighten it a bit more, or crop it off center. the left side is so much better than the right. If you cropped it with the (leaf?) ending up in the upper right, it might be stronger.</td>', 'Very nice. I like the colors. I''d be tempted to brighten it a bit more, or crop it off center. the left side is so much better than the right. If you cropped it with the (leaf?) ending up in the upper right, it might be stronger.', '2009-03-27 18:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404217, 776363, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors, but it seems awfully busy. It''s well done, but it doesn''t strike much of a chord with me.</td>', 'Very nice colors, but it seems awfully busy. It''s well done, but it doesn''t strike much of a chord with me.', '2009-03-27 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404218, 776124, 96823, '<td valign="top">good shot but not abstract IMO</td>', 'good shot but not abstract IMO', '2009-03-27 18:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404219, 775919, 103142, '<td valign="top">At first I thought, "just a nice motion shot, not that abstract." But I changed my mind the more I looked at it. Definitely abstract enough, I think it would be stronger saturated more to bring out the wonderful lines. they''re very interesting, but your eye is drawn to the yellow more.</td>', 'At first I thought, "just a nice motion shot, not that abstract." But I changed my mind the more I looked at it. Definitely abstract enough, I think it would be stronger saturated more to bring out the wonderful lines. they''re very interesting, but your eye is drawn to the yellow more.', '2009-03-27 18:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404220, 775325, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s definitely abstract enough for me, but I don''t care much for the muddy colors. I do like the white popping out from the middle. But I think abstracts benefit from cleaner, clearer colors.</td>', 'It''s definitely abstract enough for me, but I don''t care much for the muddy colors. I do like the white popping out from the middle. But I think abstracts benefit from cleaner, clearer colors.', '2009-03-27 18:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404221, 776252, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a good picture--I''m not sure it''s very abstract. the bright vertical light on the left and the blown light on the top are distracting, but I know you can''t do much about it in basic.</td>', 'It''s a good picture--I''m not sure it''s very abstract. the bright vertical light on the left and the blown light on the top are distracting, but I know you can''t do much about it in basic.', '2009-03-27 18:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
