(5404224, 774647, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the movement, and I like the photo, but it doesn''t seem very abstract. Seems more like motion blur.</td>', 'I like the movement, and I like the photo, but it doesn''t seem very abstract. Seems more like motion blur.', '2009-03-27 18:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
