(5404333, 775514, 103142, '<td valign="top">I really do like the picture, but the colors seem very muddy and drab. I know that not all abstracts need bright colors, but I feel this one would be much stronger with them.</td>', 'I really do like the picture, but the colors seem very muddy and drab. I know that not all abstracts need bright colors, but I feel this one would be much stronger with them.', '2009-03-27 19:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
