(5404384, 776386, 96823, '<td valign="top">This maybe abstract but theres no motion to it.</td>', 'This maybe abstract but theres no motion to it.', '2009-03-27 20:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404387, 776381, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of water drops, but theres no abstract to it. Just water drops frozen in time.</td>', 'Nice shot of water drops, but theres no abstract to it. Just water drops frozen in time.', '2009-03-27 20:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404396, 775812, 97166, '<td valign="top">My problem with this shot is that while I know by experience that smoke has motion, this fact isn''t conveyed well here.  It also is, well, smoke, which isn''t incredibly abstract in and of itself.   Still, the abstract does exist in the inherent unknown of the geometry of pattern, and it''s always interest to try and ''see'' something in it, so to speak.  <br/> <br/>In the end, however, I just feel it falls too far into the realm of ''just another smoke photo''.</td>', 'My problem with this shot is that while I know by experience that smoke has motion, this fact isn''t conveyed well here.  It also is, well, smoke, which isn''t incredibly abstract in and of itself.   Still, the abstract does exist in the inherent unknown of the geometry of pattern, and it''s always interest to try and ''see'' something in it, so to speak.   In the end, however, I just feel it falls too far into the realm of ''just another smoke photo''.', '2009-03-27 20:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404398, 775256, 97166, '<td valign="top">A nice energy, but the color play is a little too forceful.  There is no real coherent feel here (even an abstract should attempt to tell a story or bring cohesive interest together), so I''m left feeling a little lost and disinterested.</td>', 'A nice energy, but the color play is a little too forceful.  There is no real coherent feel here (even an abstract should attempt to tell a story or bring cohesive interest together), so I''m left feeling a little lost and disinterested.', '2009-03-27 20:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404400, 775403, 97166, '<td valign="top">It certainly has motion, but the abstract element is completely disregarded to my eyes.</td>', 'It certainly has motion, but the abstract element is completely disregarded to my eyes.', '2009-03-27 20:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404403, 775408, 97166, '<td valign="top">While the motion (the movement of the wings I presume) is present, it isn''t an inherent part of the over-all photograph.  Coupled with an almost complete lack of any abstract element, it simply doesn''t work well enough for the challenge theme.</td>', 'While the motion (the movement of the wings I presume) is present, it isn''t an inherent part of the over-all photograph.  Coupled with an almost complete lack of any abstract element, it simply doesn''t work well enough for the challenge theme.', '2009-03-27 20:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404405, 776360, 103142, '<td valign="top">I realy like this one, and I am confused on how it''s done. I really hope you give details at the end!</td>', 'I realy like this one, and I am confused on how it''s done. I really hope you give details at the end!', '2009-03-27 20:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404406, 776109, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. subtle and intersting.</td>', 'Very nice job. subtle and intersting.', '2009-03-27 20:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404407, 774798, 97166, '<td valign="top">I suppose the entropic value of the ''lava'' in these lamps has an abstract element, but a simple recording of this isn''t abstract in and of itself.  The motion, as well, is not visible here, but only implied, and only if one knows that these things actually moved and aren''t statically encased in some kind of plastic or glass.  For my money, this simply doesn''t adhere to the challenge theme.</td>', 'I suppose the entropic value of the ''lava'' in these lamps has an abstract element, but a simple recording of this isn''t abstract in and of itself.  The motion, as well, is not visible here, but only implied, and only if one knows that these things actually moved and aren''t statically encased in some kind of plastic or glass.  For my money, this simply doesn''t adhere to the challenge theme.', '2009-03-27 20:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404409, 776163, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I like it.</td>', 'Nicely done! I like it.', '2009-03-27 20:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404410, 775119, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the red and the green quite a bit, but I''m afraid that the legs really don''t add much in my mind... sorry!</td>', 'I like the red and the green quite a bit, but I''m afraid that the legs really don''t add much in my mind... sorry!', '2009-03-27 20:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404413, 776156, 97166, '<td valign="top">Some nice energy and color play.  I enjoy the sense of movement, but the crop leaves me a little wanting.  This is desperately crying for more of a panoramic type view, but alas, DPC isn''t the friendliest showcase for panoramic type shots, I know.<br/> <br/>One thing I would have done is left out the title. It clues the viewer into what your subject is, and tends to ruin the abstract feel a little.</td>', 'Some nice energy and color play.  I enjoy the sense of movement, but the crop leaves me a little wanting.  This is desperately crying for more of a panoramic type view, but alas, DPC isn''t the friendliest showcase for panoramic type shots, I know. One thing I would have done is left out the title. It clues the viewer into what your subject is, and tends to ruin the abstract feel a little.', '2009-03-27 20:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404415, 775075, 97166, '<td valign="top">It''s got a good motion to it, but the abstract connection is extremely thin.  There''s just a little too much anchorage in reality here.</td>', 'It''s got a good motion to it, but the abstract connection is extremely thin.  There''s just a little too much anchorage in reality here.', '2009-03-27 20:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404416, 776322, 97166, '<td valign="top">A very colorful and eye pleasing shot that I feel could have had a benefit from a little more sense of motion in the swirl.</td>', 'A very colorful and eye pleasing shot that I feel could have had a benefit from a little more sense of motion in the swirl.', '2009-03-27 20:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404417, 776211, 97166, '<td valign="top">The title hurts this, as it removes the sense of abstract for me. I don''t want to be told what an abstract is. I want to figure it out for myself.<br/> <br/>I also feel that it would have had a better benefit from much lighter background, as the dull grey here darkens the shot and removes a little energy from the color.</td>', 'The title hurts this, as it removes the sense of abstract for me. I don''t want to be told what an abstract is. I want to figure it out for myself. I also feel that it would have had a better benefit from much lighter background, as the dull grey here darkens the shot and removes a little energy from the color.', '2009-03-27 20:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404418, 776294, 97166, '<td valign="top">A pleasing and relaxing journey through color and a gentle rocking of wave like energy.</td>', 'A pleasing and relaxing journey through color and a gentle rocking of wave like energy.', '2009-03-27 20:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404420, 775899, 97166, '<td valign="top">I fail to get a sense of either abstract, or motion, in this photo.</td>', 'I fail to get a sense of either abstract, or motion, in this photo.', '2009-03-27 20:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404421, 776162, 97166, '<td valign="top">An explosion of energy with a wonderful gradient throughout.</td>', 'An explosion of energy with a wonderful gradient throughout.', '2009-03-27 20:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404424, 776067, 97166, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge for sure, the advancing repetition catches the attention.  It lacks a certain Joie de Vivre, however, that would set it apart.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge for sure, the advancing repetition catches the attention.  It lacks a certain Joie de Vivre, however, that would set it apart.', '2009-03-27 20:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404426, 774469, 97166, '<td valign="top">Another shot where the title should have left more to the imagination.  I would have had more interest in this photo and looked at it longer had I not seen the title and was then instantly connected.<br/> <br/>Other than that, I do like the sense of motion and the rendering of a static subject into an abstract manner.</td>', 'Another shot where the title should have left more to the imagination.  I would have had more interest in this photo and looked at it longer had I not seen the title and was then instantly connected. Other than that, I do like the sense of motion and the rendering of a static subject into an abstract manner.', '2009-03-27 20:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404427, 775823, 97166, '<td valign="top">The harsh contrast nature of this photo doesn''t do a lot for me, and I''m not sold on the simple motion blur.</td>', 'The harsh contrast nature of this photo doesn''t do a lot for me, and I''m not sold on the simple motion blur.', '2009-03-27 20:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404428, 775706, 97166, '<td valign="top">There''s a chaotic energy here that is very hard to ignore, and I find myself gazing into this piece and liking it more and more with every passing second.  Compositionally, it is a little unbalanced, but it reminds me of the way my mind works in the darkness of the night.</td>', 'There''s a chaotic energy here that is very hard to ignore, and I find myself gazing into this piece and liking it more and more with every passing second.  Compositionally, it is a little unbalanced, but it reminds me of the way my mind works in the darkness of the night.', '2009-03-27 20:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404429, 775260, 97166, '<td valign="top">This would have worked for me far better without the title, pointing to the obvious.</td>', 'This would have worked for me far better without the title, pointing to the obvious.', '2009-03-27 20:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404430, 775402, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." It is a very nice shot, but other than the colors being different, it doesn''t seem very abstract to me.</td>', 'I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." It is a very nice shot, but other than the colors being different, it doesn''t seem very abstract to me.', '2009-03-27 20:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404431, 776389, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very simple, very elegant, very nice!</td>', 'Very simple, very elegant, very nice!', '2009-03-27 20:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404433, 775256, 103142, '<td valign="top">It certainly is abstract, and certainly has movement, but, I''m sorry, but I don''t find it very compelling. I think it would actually be much stronger without the colors at the top. The blues and pinks are very lovely, but the red and gold/orange doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture (IMO only)</td>', 'It certainly is abstract, and certainly has movement, but, I''m sorry, but I don''t find it very compelling. I think it would actually be much stronger without the colors at the top. The blues and pinks are very lovely, but the red and gold/orange doesn''t seem to add anything to the picture (IMO only)', '2009-03-27 20:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404434, 776344, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very lovely. Well done image.</td>', 'Very lovely. Well done image.', '2009-03-27 20:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404435, 776071, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting, but it''s actually kind of painful to look at -- it''s so bright.</td>', 'It''s interesting, but it''s actually kind of painful to look at -- it''s so bright.', '2009-03-27 20:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404436, 776397, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the colors very much, but I don''t find the rest very compelling. perhaps if the lines/items were going at more of a diagonal. It seems kind of static.</td>', 'I like the colors very much, but I don''t find the rest very compelling. perhaps if the lines/items were going at more of a diagonal. It seems kind of static.', '2009-03-27 20:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404437, 776367, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." It''s a very nice photo, but it seems very realistic, not very abstract.</td>', 'I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." It''s a very nice photo, but it seems very realistic, not very abstract.', '2009-03-27 20:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
