(5404448, 776101, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." I know that the water doesn''t really look like that, but so many photographs do water this way that this seems much more realistic than abstract to me.</td>', 'I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." I know that the water doesn''t really look like that, but so many photographs do water this way that this seems much more realistic than abstract to me.', '2009-03-27 20:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404449, 776004, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m not that fond of the picture, but your title is perfect!</td>', 'I''m not that fond of the picture, but your title is perfect!', '2009-03-27 20:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5404451, 776327, 103142, '<td valign="top">My first thought was "way too messy", but actually, after you look at it for a little while, the messiness is fun!</td>', 'My first thought was "way too messy", but actually, after you look at it for a little while, the messiness is fun!', '2009-03-27 20:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
