(5405019, 776293, 70270, '<td valign="top">nice motion blur, but no abstractness scores this poorly in this challenge.  Beyond that, the lines in the background and the pnuematic hose curving in and out of the bottom edge hurt the composition.  Needs a bit more midtone contrast and more detail in the blacks to really pop as a B+W.  Nice try.</td>', 'nice motion blur, but no abstractness scores this poorly in this challenge.  Beyond that, the lines in the background and the pnuematic hose curving in and out of the bottom edge hurt the composition.  Needs a bit more midtone contrast and more detail in the blacks to really pop as a B+W.  Nice try.', '2009-03-28 09:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405028, 776401, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! The colors are good the lighting is good. I would like to know how you did this!</td>', 'Nicely done! The colors are good the lighting is good. I would like to know how you did this!', '2009-03-28 09:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405030, 774467, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2009-03-28 09:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405034, 775657, 96823, '<td valign="top">Not abstract IMO.</td>', 'Not abstract IMO.', '2009-03-28 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405038, 774798, 70270, '<td valign="top">I get your oobie take ... abstract motion inside the lava lamp.  Still DNMC (cuz you didn''t use the camera to create the motion), but I''m willing to overlook that.  What I can''t overlook is the overall green-yellow cast to the image (which could be corrected with a simple white balance adjustment), the dust or spots and soft focus on the leftmost lamp, and the trapped negative space between the three lamps.  A tighter focus on a single lamp and some external lighting, or a different setup of the three lamps would have really helped here.</td>', 'I get your oobie take ... abstract motion inside the lava lamp.  Still DNMC (cuz you didn''t use the camera to create the motion), but I''m willing to overlook that.  What I can''t overlook is the overall green-yellow cast to the image (which could be corrected with a simple white balance adjustment), the dust or spots and soft focus on the leftmost lamp, and the trapped negative space between the three lamps.  A tighter focus on a single lamp and some external lighting, or a different setup of the three lamps would have really helped here.', '2009-03-28 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405039, 776113, 70270, '<td valign="top">Another DNMC, but an oobie take that I can overlook (as with the other similar shot in this challenge).  Like the focus ona  single lamp, but think you need to come in closer and wait for that big blob in the middle to break into several smaller ones, and adjust exposure to avoid blowing the highlights out.  Lighting is too harsh; needs something external to soften it.  White balance needs to be adjusted to remove the green cast, and next time flip the lamp around sound the ding on the base isn''t showing.</td>', 'Another DNMC, but an oobie take that I can overlook (as with the other similar shot in this challenge).  Like the focus ona  single lamp, but think you need to come in closer and wait for that big blob in the middle to break into several smaller ones, and adjust exposure to avoid blowing the highlights out.  Lighting is too harsh; needs something external to soften it.  White balance needs to be adjusted to remove the green cast, and next time flip the lamp around sound the ding on the base isn''t showing.', '2009-03-28 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405040, 776316, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of light dancing on water.</td>', 'Nice shot of light dancing on water.', '2009-03-28 09:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405041, 775919, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, maybe better in B&amp;W JMO.</td>', 'Nice shot, maybe better in B&W JMO.', '2009-03-28 09:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405044, 775812, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m torn on this one. It''s very interesting, and very well done. But unless I''m completely off, it is smoke trails. I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." and other than the colors, it still looks like smoke trails. Since I can''t rate it high if I think it DNMC, and since I won''t mark it low in case I''m wrong, I''m going to pass on voting. It is very nice!</td>', 'I''m torn on this one. It''s very interesting, and very well done. But unless I''m completely off, it is smoke trails. I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." and other than the colors, it still looks like smoke trails. Since I can''t rate it high if I think it DNMC, and since I won''t mark it low in case I''m wrong, I''m going to pass on voting. It is very nice!', '2009-03-28 09:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405045, 774971, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." With this in mind, it really doesn''t fit abstract, IMO.</td>', 'I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." With this in mind, it really doesn''t fit abstract, IMO.', '2009-03-28 09:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405048, 774501, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but it looks like there''s a lot of reflection off the glass. (I could be wrong...) But the colors in the lower right are so much more interesting than all the white/filmy stuff on the left from the reflections. I washes things out and isn''t as pleasing as it could have been.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but it looks like there''s a lot of reflection off the glass. (I could be wrong...) But the colors in the lower right are so much more interesting than all the white/filmy stuff on the left from the reflections. I washes things out and isn''t as pleasing as it could have been.', '2009-03-28 09:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405049, 775834, 96823, '<td valign="top">Nice shot for abstract lighting. And yes I understand that the vehicles are moving but it''s just not working for me. JMO</td>', 'Nice shot for abstract lighting. And yes I understand that the vehicles are moving but it''s just not working for me. JMO', '2009-03-28 10:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405050, 775979, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m having a hard time with this, because I''ve voted other photos with the main subject in focus as not abstract. I really like this, though. But, I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." Sorry, I can''t go higher than a 6 if I think that it does not meet the challenge. I hope a 6 doesn''t hurt your score, because I do like the picture!</td>', 'I''m having a hard time with this, because I''ve voted other photos with the main subject in focus as not abstract. I really like this, though. But, I''ve been using the definition: "Of, relating to, or being a style of art in which natural objects are not represented realistically." Sorry, I can''t go higher than a 6 if I think that it does not meet the challenge. I hope a 6 doesn''t hurt your score, because I do like the picture!', '2009-03-28 10:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5405051, 776266, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s very interesting, and well done. But since the golds have such a wonderful glow, I would have liked them to pop a little more.</td>', 'It''s very interesting, and well done. But since the golds have such a wonderful glow, I would have liked them to pop a little more.', '2009-03-28 10:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
