(5407871, 774575, 30364, '<td valign="top">In the outback, an Aussie named Blue<br/>told his mate Kev the Kiwi, "Kev, you<br/>can keep all your cheap<br/>Kiwi passion for sheep,<br/>but a ''roo in a tutu?  Woohoo!"</td>', 'In the outback, an Aussie named Bluetold his mate Kev the Kiwi, "Kev, youcan keep all your cheapKiwi passion for sheep,but a ''roo in a tutu?  Woohoo!"', '2009-03-30 09:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
