(5409111, 774793, 102645, '<td valign="top">I appears that you are using a really quick shutter speed when the challenge would of suggested you either use a longer one to express motion, or move your camera.</td>', 'I appears that you are using a really quick shutter speed when the challenge would of suggested you either use a longer one to express motion, or move your camera.', '2009-03-30 21:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409113, 774595, 102645, '<td valign="top">I think that using such a quick shutter speed defeats the purpose of the challenge in which you want to express the motion of the water.</td>', 'I think that using such a quick shutter speed defeats the purpose of the challenge in which you want to express the motion of the water.', '2009-03-30 21:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409114, 774798, 102645, '<td valign="top">How many people in this challenge have yellow lava lamps?</td>', 'How many people in this challenge have yellow lava lamps?', '2009-03-30 21:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409157, 774737, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful.  As if the earth shifted while they were all in flight.  White birds in a black sky; a touch of M C Escher, and a lovely kind of hint at the glorious enigma of the Heisenberg Uncertainty Principle.  10.  And the Order of the Thumb:<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=748778" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30364/120/748778.jpg"/></a></td>', 'This is wonderful.  As if the earth shifted while they were all in flight.  White birds in a black sky; a touch of M C Escher, and a lovely kind of hint at the glorious enigma of the Heisenberg Uncertainty Principle.  10.  And the Order of the Thumb:', '2009-03-30 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409158, 776330, 30364, '<td valign="top">It certainly could look just like this.  Why not?  There''s beauty, order and chaos all together in a <i>Pas de Trois.</i>  Isn''t that what we''d expect, when the God Particle is revealed?  9.</td>', 'It certainly could look just like this.  Why not?  There''s beauty, order and chaos all together in a Pas de Trois.  Isn''t that what we''d expect, when the God Particle is revealed?  9.', '2009-03-30 22:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409164, 775061, 93543, '<td valign="top">Great picture and processing. Fits challenge perfectly.</td>', 'Great picture and processing. Fits challenge perfectly.', '2009-03-30 22:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409253, 776230, 96915, '<td valign="top">This is just beautiful. I wish I had more words for it. 10</td>', 'This is just beautiful. I wish I had more words for it. 10', '2009-03-30 23:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409285, 775254, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, and there''s definite motion, but I''m not finding the patterns very compelling. I''m sorry...</td>', 'I like the colors, and there''s definite motion, but I''m not finding the patterns very compelling. I''m sorry...', '2009-03-30 23:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409286, 775706, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the color, and it''s an interesting design. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like the color, and it''s an interesting design. Nicely done.', '2009-03-30 23:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
