(5409776, 776140, 103916, '<td valign="top">Love the curves in the picture.  What I like the best is that its a motion picture that you can actually make out.  Staring closely at the buildings on the left you, can even make out the windows.  And of course the black and white color give the picture much drama.  I like it!</td>', 'Love the curves in the picture.  What I like the best is that its a motion picture that you can actually make out.  Staring closely at the buildings on the left you, can even make out the windows.  And of course the black and white color give the picture much drama.  I like it!', '2009-03-31 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409777, 775402, 103916, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Im impressed with how clear the picture came out even though its obvious that it is a motion photograph because, of the snow behind the snow boarder.  Nice.</td>', 'Very nice!  Im impressed with how clear the picture came out even though its obvious that it is a motion photograph because, of the snow behind the snow boarder.  Nice.', '2009-03-31 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409781, 776273, 103916, '<td valign="top">This looks like a paiting.  What a fantastic photograph.  The colors arent all mixed together.  ALthough the picture is in motion you can still identify the subjects in the photograph.  Very nice!</td>', 'This looks like a paiting.  What a fantastic photograph.  The colors arent all mixed together.  ALthough the picture is in motion you can still identify the subjects in the photograph.  Very nice!', '2009-03-31 10:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409782, 775909, 103916, '<td valign="top">What a graceful photograph.  Very nice</td>', 'What a graceful photograph.  Very nice', '2009-03-31 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409784, 776243, 103916, '<td valign="top">This has the appeal of a painting.  Definetly keeps you staring into the screen to try and see what else can be found.  I love the colors.  Great Job</td>', 'This has the appeal of a painting.  Definetly keeps you staring into the screen to try and see what else can be found.  I love the colors.  Great Job', '2009-03-31 10:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409786, 775403, 103916, '<td valign="top">I love water falls.  Even mini ones!  =)  Fantastic photograph</td>', 'I love water falls.  Even mini ones!  =)  Fantastic photograph', '2009-03-31 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409789, 775314, 103916, '<td valign="top">You know this photgraph has so much color and activity.  Only when you star directly into each of the "rides" can you see that they are in motion.  I really liked that...not only are you giving the viewer a kicker with the colors, and subjects but, once they look deep into the photograph will they realize that the rides are in motion.  Very nice!</td>', 'You know this photgraph has so much color and activity.  Only when you star directly into each of the "rides" can you see that they are in motion.  I really liked that...not only are you giving the viewer a kicker with the colors, and subjects but, once they look deep into the photograph will they realize that the rides are in motion.  Very nice!', '2009-03-31 10:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409790, 774707, 103916, '<td valign="top">Interesting!</td>', 'Interesting!', '2009-03-31 10:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409792, 775580, 103916, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but, its hard to even make out what is in the photograph.</td>', 'I like the idea but, its hard to even make out what is in the photograph.', '2009-03-31 10:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409793, 776252, 103916, '<td valign="top">Very nice photograph.  I like the idea but, have seen so many of these types of photographs.</td>', 'Very nice photograph.  I like the idea but, have seen so many of these types of photographs.', '2009-03-31 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409795, 776322, 103916, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic!!!  I love the color and I love your theme.  I can see this in a calendar of some type.  Great Job!</td>', 'This is fantastic!!!  I love the color and I love your theme.  I can see this in a calendar of some type.  Great Job!', '2009-03-31 10:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
