(5409879, 776245, 97166, '<td valign="top">An interesting format choice, but the photograph itself isn''t attracting much attention from me.  I don''t really get a sense of ''motion'' overall either.</td>', 'An interesting format choice, but the photograph itself isn''t attracting much attention from me.  I don''t really get a sense of ''motion'' overall either.', '2009-03-31 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409881, 775325, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nice use of zoom blur, but the presentation remains a little static in my eyes.  I don''t really get a while lot of a sense of motion in this.</td>', 'Nice use of zoom blur, but the presentation remains a little static in my eyes.  I don''t really get a while lot of a sense of motion in this.', '2009-03-31 12:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409884, 775798, 97166, '<td valign="top">Nicely presented compositionally, but a little dull color wise for me. It screams for richer saturation.</td>', 'Nicely presented compositionally, but a little dull color wise for me. It screams for richer saturation.', '2009-03-31 12:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409885, 776142, 97166, '<td valign="top">Although the sense of motion is very muted here, there is something about this shot that really grabs the attention. It is almost ethereal, ghostly.</td>', 'Although the sense of motion is very muted here, there is something about this shot that really grabs the attention. It is almost ethereal, ghostly.', '2009-03-31 12:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409886, 775966, 97166, '<td valign="top">Just a little too chaotic and unbalanced for my tastes.</td>', 'Just a little too chaotic and unbalanced for my tastes.', '2009-03-31 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409890, 775402, 97166, '<td valign="top">For me, you''ve missed both aspects of the challenge theme here.  You''ve frozen the motion, and you haven''t really presented any real aspect of Abstract.</td>', 'For me, you''ve missed both aspects of the challenge theme here.  You''ve frozen the motion, and you haven''t really presented any real aspect of Abstract.', '2009-03-31 12:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409891, 774731, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m really enjoying this one. It has a great sense of energy and an ethereal quality (which I would have felt without the redundant title).</td>', 'I''m really enjoying this one. It has a great sense of energy and an ethereal quality (which I would have felt without the redundant title).', '2009-03-31 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409892, 775824, 97166, '<td valign="top">This is a nice take on the challenge, although the high-contrasty coloration isn''t my favorite.</td>', 'This is a nice take on the challenge, although the high-contrasty coloration isn''t my favorite.', '2009-03-31 12:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409894, 776192, 97166, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge theme, but misses a little something in presentation for me, although I imagine it might be more of a negative bias to the blocky geometry than anything.</td>', 'Fits the challenge theme, but misses a little something in presentation for me, although I imagine it might be more of a negative bias to the blocky geometry than anything.', '2009-03-31 12:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409899, 776257, 97166, '<td valign="top">Great energy here, although I see badgers, not foxes.  Titles like this on abstract works are redundant, I feel.  The artist in an Abstract challenge should not, in my opinion, force their vision on the viewer. They should let the viewer discover and interpret on their own.</td>', 'Great energy here, although I see badgers, not foxes.  Titles like this on abstract works are redundant, I feel.  The artist in an Abstract challenge should not, in my opinion, force their vision on the viewer. They should let the viewer discover and interpret on their own.', '2009-03-31 12:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409901, 775282, 97166, '<td valign="top">Some nice flowing lines here, and a great abstract presentation that mimics a realistic scene, but in overall presentation I feel that it lacks the motion.  I can see the lines themselves that have been swept, but I don''t feel motion in the scene.</td>', 'Some nice flowing lines here, and a great abstract presentation that mimics a realistic scene, but in overall presentation I feel that it lacks the motion.  I can see the lines themselves that have been swept, but I don''t feel motion in the scene.', '2009-03-31 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409903, 775913, 97166, '<td valign="top">More motion than abstract in my view, but not a whole lot of either. A little bit of motion blur doesn''t really convey ''motion'' to me, as much as it just conveys a static scene that has been brushed a bit.</td>', 'More motion than abstract in my view, but not a whole lot of either. A little bit of motion blur doesn''t really convey ''motion'' to me, as much as it just conveys a static scene that has been brushed a bit.', '2009-03-31 12:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5409904, 776103, 97166, '<td valign="top">It''s got enough elements of motion and abstract to fit the challenge well.</td>', 'It''s got enough elements of motion and abstract to fit the challenge well.', '2009-03-31 12:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
