(5410114, 776139, 97166, '<td valign="top">I actually took a few shots like this for this challenge (never ended up entereing), but wasn''t brave enough to enter one.  At the time, I didn''t feel it ended up being abstract enough, and I still feel the same.</td>', 'I actually took a few shots like this for this challenge (never ended up entereing), but wasn''t brave enough to enter one.  At the time, I didn''t feel it ended up being abstract enough, and I still feel the same.', '2009-03-31 14:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410115, 776124, 97166, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t actually show any motion in my view. There''s no sense of movement, only the suggestion of through the hope of viewer understanding.  Were I a person that had never seen a lava lamp, I could, based on this photo, conclude that these are merely shapes encased in glass or plastic.  I also really don''t get much of an abstract feeling out of it.</td>', 'This doesn''t actually show any motion in my view. There''s no sense of movement, only the suggestion of through the hope of viewer understanding.  Were I a person that had never seen a lava lamp, I could, based on this photo, conclude that these are merely shapes encased in glass or plastic.  I also really don''t get much of an abstract feeling out of it.', '2009-03-31 14:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410116, 776391, 97166, '<td valign="top">It seems to me as if a filter was applied here, and the result isn''t really all that pleasing to me.</td>', 'It seems to me as if a filter was applied here, and the result isn''t really all that pleasing to me.', '2009-03-31 14:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410120, 776268, 97166, '<td valign="top">While it does contain a zoom blur, it doesn''t really convey ''motion'' to me as much as it does a simple static scene being stretched.  While that would certainly mean that the photograph itself is ''in motion'' in a sense, the scene still plays out as static and unmoving.</td>', 'While it does contain a zoom blur, it doesn''t really convey ''motion'' to me as much as it does a simple static scene being stretched.  While that would certainly mean that the photograph itself is ''in motion'' in a sense, the scene still plays out as static and unmoving.', '2009-03-31 14:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410124, 774449, 97166, '<td valign="top">kind of dizzying, definitely abstract, but this kind of motion blur still doesn''t convey much ''motion'' to me on an overall basis.</td>', 'kind of dizzying, definitely abstract, but this kind of motion blur still doesn''t convey much ''motion'' to me on an overall basis.', '2009-03-31 14:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410125, 774845, 97166, '<td valign="top">While I know that the light that created this had to have been in motion, the scene itself is very static and doesn''t convey that motion to me, the viewer.</td>', 'While I know that the light that created this had to have been in motion, the scene itself is very static and doesn''t convey that motion to me, the viewer.', '2009-03-31 14:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410128, 775118, 97166, '<td valign="top">Taking a scene and simply adding a motion blur of some kind to it isn''t a great example of an Abstract idea, to me.</td>', 'Taking a scene and simply adding a motion blur of some kind to it isn''t a great example of an Abstract idea, to me.', '2009-03-31 14:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410129, 776004, 97166, '<td valign="top">The noise doesn''t enhance this photo in any way for me, and what is left is a pretty basic star-trail shot that doesn''t really pique my interest.</td>', 'The noise doesn''t enhance this photo in any way for me, and what is left is a pretty basic star-trail shot that doesn''t really pique my interest.', '2009-03-31 14:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410136, 775707, 97166, '<td valign="top">Conceptually abstract, if not entirely visually, but the sense of motion conveyed by the longer shutter speed isn''t really all that strong for me. It''s shaky, but I really don''t get the sense that either the object with the point of view is moving, or the objects around it are moving. ''jittery'', to me, isn''t really ''motion''.</td>', 'Conceptually abstract, if not entirely visually, but the sense of motion conveyed by the longer shutter speed isn''t really all that strong for me. It''s shaky, but I really don''t get the sense that either the object with the point of view is moving, or the objects around it are moving. ''jittery'', to me, isn''t really ''motion''.', '2009-03-31 14:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5410138, 774647, 97166, '<td valign="top">The motion, to me, may be a little too subtle for this challenge, and the abstract is next to non-existent outside of a very conceptual basis.</td>', 'The motion, to me, may be a little too subtle for this challenge, and the abstract is next to non-existent outside of a very conceptual basis.', '2009-03-31 14:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
