(5410907, 776360, 102645, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for their comments.  I do appreciate them all.  I am very pleased with this result.  I think it did quite well considering it was my second entry (my first one bombed), and all the confusion about what abstract is.  Some people think it is abstract while others do not.<br/> <br/>Here is how I came of this photo.  I was actually on the top level of a parking garage shooting some cranes adjacent (I really like cranes for some reason right now).  I then noticed this building across the street and how with my angle the reflection led to the street below.  Thought the warping windows and a long exposure would produce some neat results, and sure enough it did.  All the windows with a mirror like reflection had their office lights turned off.  The office in the image didn''t, so I chose to focus mainly on that as I knew it would show in the exposure.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for their comments.  I do appreciate them all.  I am very pleased with this result.  I think it did quite well considering it was my second entry (my first one bombed), and all the confusion about what abstract is.  Some people think it is abstract while others do not. Here is how I came of this photo.  I was actually on the top level of a parking garage shooting some cranes adjacent (I really like cranes for some reason right now).  I then noticed this building across the street and how with my angle the reflection led to the street below.  Thought the warping windows and a long exposure would produce some neat results, and sure enough it did.  All the windows with a mirror like reflection had their office lights turned off.  The office in the image didn''t, so I chose to focus mainly on that as I knew it would show in the exposure.', '2009-04-01 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5410909, 775895, 23430, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your First BLUE. Well done.</td>', 'Congrats on your First BLUE. Well done.', '2009-04-01 01:13:23.000000', NULL, 0),
