(5411475, 775403, 97065, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments ...<br/> <br/>very well seems not to be too abstract ;) <br/> <br/>i had some much bolder shots in mind however was restricted by terrain and shoes. problem 1 : right after the lil waterfall is a rather deep basin. (too deep to stand in ) fortunately i found 2 stepping stones one of them not very stable though. unfortunately the stepping stones had no idea of human anatomy so i could stand on them only in a very uncomfortable way. <br/>to avoid falling into the basin filled with cold water with my cam i took rather fast shots...<br/> <br/>on the other hand .. a 2 sec shot while i fall into the basin with the cam would have given the motion the missed abstraction ... i ll consider that for next abstract motion contest.<br/> <br/>problem2: never forget a pair of rubber boots when walking in a creek .<br/> <br/></td>', 'thanks for the comments ... very well seems not to be too abstract ;)  i had some much bolder shots in mind however was restricted by terrain and shoes. problem 1 : right after the lil waterfall is a rather deep basin. (too deep to stand in ) fortunately i found 2 stepping stones one of them not very stable though. unfortunately the stepping stones had no idea of human anatomy so i could stand on them only in a very uncomfortable way. to avoid falling into the basin filled with cold water with my cam i took rather fast shots... on the other hand .. a 2 sec shot while i fall into the basin with the cam would have given the motion the missed abstraction ... i ll consider that for next abstract motion contest. problem2: never forget a pair of rubber boots when walking in a creek . ', '2009-04-01 04:25:40.000000', NULL, 0),
